{
"file": 1156,
"paths": [
"d009/d039/f051"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "98a45c11",
"en_raw": "Dr. Takehiko~!"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "5a297969",
"en_raw": "You see, I'm well!"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "1756e010",
"en_raw": "I go on Melos's walks"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "b2130c12",
"en_raw": "with Nao and Sango"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "adc9b808",
"en_raw": "Since I became friends with Melos"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "8b665624",
"en_raw": "Kurumi sometimes"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "269935c7",
"en_raw": "gets to hold the leash~"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "1821f79e",
"en_raw": "And then, Sango..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "6b5669de",
"en_raw": "Yeah, they seem so happy"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "afb9beb1",
"en_raw": "it's almost troubling"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "b83a5f78",
"en_raw": "And those Nao and"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "eeae2418",
"en_raw": "Sango, are they from school?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "c7de5f3e",
"en_raw": "Friends!"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "825060f6",
"en_raw": "And Melos is"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "a40a1810",
"en_raw": "a dog~!"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "1a880ecd",
"en_raw": "Kurumi, greet properly, okay?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "579beeba",
"en_raw": "So you're walking a dog"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "4f8609c5",
"en_raw": "with school friends"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "b3c8c233",
"en_raw": "And what kind of dog is it?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "45db58ad",
"en_raw": "Hmm, well,"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "232ed5d4",
"en_raw": "Melos is pretty big~"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "ece736f5",
"en_raw": "And sometimes he laughs~"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "d7902b99",
"en_raw": "he sticks out his tongue like uhihi"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "5d32083c",
"en_raw": "Is that true~?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "71a9be31",
"en_raw": "It's true, Melos laughs"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "e50065de",
"en_raw": "Hey hey hey hey"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "8f0879da",
"en_raw": "Dr. Takehiko, come along too~"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "0b7bc4b7",
"en_raw": "Yeah, yeah..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "3d98931c",
"en_raw": "Good morning!"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "f08692f6",
"en_raw": "Oh, good morning"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "42f34ef1",
"en_raw": "You're awfully early"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "476d745c",
"en_raw": "Was that bad?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "1fd17600",
"en_raw": "Ah, no, not at all"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "30d179eb",
"en_raw": "More importantly, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "98905209",
"en_raw": "how's school?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "b6df4fa5",
"en_raw": "Then I'll leave it to you"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "9f5a5bd7",
"en_raw": "Doing well?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "e8228589",
"en_raw": "That story again"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "16fd0157",
"en_raw": "Quit making me angry"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "fe8270c9",
"en_raw": "Kurumi isn't something to"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "c9965a9a",
"en_raw": "treat or..."
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "44cf6ead",
"en_raw": "I know your hard work"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "9b4a899d",
"en_raw": "Call it parental ego"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "7b465059",
"en_raw": "or whatever you like"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "eccb82c9",
"en_raw": "Takehiko"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "4369adc1",
"en_raw": "you're an important ally"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "175323bb",
"en_raw": "I'd like you to keep"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "34fcec97",
"en_raw": "that view"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "ea780304",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I oppose that plan"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "98a45c11",
"en_raw": "Dr. Takehiko~!"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "5159c755",
"en_raw": "What happened the other day?"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "d939ed44",
"en_raw": "When I have time next"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "d1d0028b",
"en_raw": "let's drink, okay!"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "1cae0a3e",
"en_raw": "Ah, no, it's nothing"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "f72fb796",
"en_raw": "As you guessed"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "642ab078",
"en_raw": "I had a fight with Masayo"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "0324e9be",
"en_raw": "I was worked up at midnight"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "e11cfb50",
"en_raw": "Sorry to worry you"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "4a1a8e62",
"en_raw": "If that's all, fine..."
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "126a7e38",
"en_raw": "Well, there's only one thing I can say"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "5e637e05",
"en_raw": "Understand her"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "124f2f5a",
"en_raw": "Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "96931152",
"en_raw": "To a child, parents are everything"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "3dfa9734",
"en_raw": "Well, whatever!"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "df609fc5",
"en_raw": "I'm tired of these talks lately"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "424752d4",
"en_raw": "Dr. Takehiko~!"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "c225476b",
"en_raw": "And then..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "d455c4b3",
"en_raw": "I see, I see"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "19fe28ac",
"en_raw": "Glad you seem happy"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "6d1775ca",
"en_raw": "But lately"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "d48335c2",
"en_raw": "it's all Melos stories"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "1cb14b53",
"en_raw": "I'd like to hear about"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "f59c625b",
"en_raw": "Mom and Kou too"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "1f26f0bd",
"en_raw": "Kou doesn't play much"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "53c361d6",
"en_raw": "Kou has soccer"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "3c020181",
"en_raw": "and Mom is... no good"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "2918955a",
"en_raw": "Kurumi hates medicine"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "a5767819",
"en_raw": "and Mom gets angry..."
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "0f055e85",
"en_raw": "Hello!"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "0312cb9b",
"en_raw": "Well, hello"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "2deb2cb0",
"en_raw": "Kurumi looks"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "1e96d98b",
"en_raw": "lively again today"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "7e63746d",
"en_raw": "Then, I'll leave it to you"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "8cf66faf",
"en_raw": "Right away"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "213e9c97",
"en_raw": "are you still going"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "087dffe6",
"en_raw": "on Melos's walks?"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "ff6fc33e",
"en_raw": "Okay!"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "3091daed",
"en_raw": "You see, the other day"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "a70efb12",
"en_raw": "we went to an amazing place"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "1e044f09",
"en_raw": "Hey?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "f3b6e0be",
"en_raw": "I'll hear about it after"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "bd7a4128",
"en_raw": "I thought I should talk first"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "18f20fa1",
"en_raw": "but..."
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "747657c4",
"en_raw": "This kind of thing"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "17879146",
"en_raw": "is hard without"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "230e2086",
"en_raw": "a relationship of trust"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "bad47f71",
"en_raw": "If you don't like"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "14f15747",
"en_raw": "my way of doing things..."
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "49165f38",
"en_raw": "I want you to cooperate too"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "2721e540",
"en_raw": "Refused, she isn't sick"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "be1f9696",
"en_raw": "Talk it over again"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "d565f094",
"en_raw": "with Masayo, as a couple"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "edfe65fa",
"en_raw": "Start from the beginning"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "fa1cc476",
"en_raw": "I can understand your feelings"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "3396897b",
"en_raw": "...So?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "24a7e7f5",
"en_raw": "Where did you get the medicine?"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "3ea8725a",
"en_raw": "Who examined her"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "e991c132",
"en_raw": "and what prescription did they write?"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "6b92a03e",
"en_raw": "Sorry, but you're no use for this"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "657183e9",
"en_raw": "Put Masayo on"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "17c8ef4e",
"en_raw": "Masayo?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "4be308bb",
"en_raw": "It's been a while since I heard your voice"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "f2640a6e",
"en_raw": "How's life as a full-time homemaker?"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "366fec98",
"en_raw": "Seems like it's tough in many ways..."
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "4b8a5fa1",
"en_raw": "Takehiko, I'm listening"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "79ad6510",
"en_raw": "The story of Friday before last"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "fd132a02",
"en_raw": "I want to hear it in detail"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "1a2082fa",
"en_raw": "You've changed, Masayo"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "845b7703",
"en_raw": "Takehiko"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "58c9c938",
"en_raw": "I'm Kurumi's parent"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "e1962bbc",
"en_raw": "What makes Kurumi happy"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "3a0ba49e",
"en_raw": "is something we should find"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "2eaa349e",
"en_raw": "That's fair"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "b583095f",
"en_raw": "But Kurumi is..."
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "cbc08a5d",
"en_raw": "As for Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "bd282e5f",
"en_raw": "I'll entrust her to Dr. Akigawa"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "dc8134ab",
"en_raw": "!!?"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "a8b7cea8",
"en_raw": "Wait, wait"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "40e73dfb",
"en_raw": "Masayo, that's..."
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "845b7703",
"en_raw": "Takehiko"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "6609bc68",
"en_raw": "I'm grateful for everything so far"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "d04aeeb3",
"en_raw": "I am grateful, but"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "b63e64cc",
"en_raw": "I can't bear it anymore"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "87b4cb9e",
"en_raw": "...I don't care what you think"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "61a2bbb8",
"en_raw": "...It's a school conference"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "261a3405",
"en_raw": "I want Kurumi to be able to"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "cb1ee363",
"en_raw": "go out into society, so"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "0c08effd",
"en_raw": "I'll choose the truly right way"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "6d5a89f2",
"en_raw": "As for Akigawa"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "3c969521",
"en_raw": "I think I know him well"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "de9b3913",
"en_raw": "He is certainly a clever guy"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "f461b97d",
"en_raw": "But he"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "a76dcb7b",
"en_raw": "thinks of people's hearts like machines"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "996b8da1",
"en_raw": "He"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "d8d8f457",
"en_raw": "can't understand Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "cee07dd7",
"en_raw": "Already..."
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "a27a23fe",
"en_raw": "It's decided"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "ad2d2aca",
"en_raw": "What kind of parent"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "ea508129",
"en_raw": "Phew..."
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "8ecfbdbc",
"en_raw": "Is this the present of my ideal woman"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "cad76b5d",
"en_raw": "As for losing things"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "cde44bfc",
"en_raw": "I thought I was used to it..."
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "08de2ff0",
"en_raw": "Masayo came out of it, but"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "010514f7",
"en_raw": "it seems she's been through a lot"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "ad385b0e",
"en_raw": "Certainly in today's education"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "1478a242",
"en_raw": "Kurumi would be a difficult"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "23d10407",
"en_raw": "case"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "448116d2",
"en_raw": "She couldn't endure"
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "08718980",
"en_raw": "the world's eyes on her child"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "37c20184",
"en_raw": "That's harsh..."
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "78dab80a",
"en_raw": "Well, Masayo too"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "e007d70f",
"en_raw": "is an ordinary mother"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "33176b8d",
"en_raw": "Feels like a house search"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "8b15de7c",
"en_raw": "I've seen it"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "c227ed57",
"en_raw": "You're as pushy as ever"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "2cfa384e",
"en_raw": "Well, all right"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "98ad23d3",
"en_raw": "I'll take up that debate"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "e9b14cdf",
"en_raw": "...The brain, at its core, is"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "500f9f73",
"en_raw": "just an information exchange of physiology"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "490d5c49",
"en_raw": "And this information exchange"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "fcbc0ac3",
"en_raw": "isn't a machine, so it's not perfect"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "1220be47",
"en_raw": "Its processing power"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "d4d90a47",
"en_raw": "varies greatly"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "6a701e0b",
"en_raw": "by the balance of brain chemicals"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "066d40d2",
"en_raw": "...A UFO is truly"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "1878eefb",
"en_raw": "a typical misinformation"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "9d517ff8",
"en_raw": "That's what you want to say, right?"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "c1d77c05",
"en_raw": "Rather, senior, you"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "528817ce",
"en_raw": "always drink too much"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "aeaba32f",
"en_raw": "This is all the charts, right"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "952a492a",
"en_raw": "Then I'll take them"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "7be9d86c",
"en_raw": "Hahaha"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "2b7fc8ca",
"en_raw": "You're an interesting guy, and smart"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "00709106",
"en_raw": "So why can't you grasp"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "437539f8",
"en_raw": "something this simple"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "7221f33c",
"en_raw": "I always wonder"
},
{
"n": 191,
"h": "909c5198",
"en_raw": "You can't cure patients with abstract theory"
},
{
"n": 192,
"h": "41e2dc63",
"en_raw": "But my research contributes"
},
{
"n": 193,
"h": "0be3f67f",
"en_raw": "...That's the one fact"
},
{
"n": 194,
"h": "983844d5",
"en_raw": "Information exchanges"
},
{
"n": 195,
"h": "4c43ea6a",
"en_raw": "exist as many as lives in this world"
},
{
"n": 196,
"h": "e7f4a660",
"en_raw": "The facts and truths you speak of"
},
{
"n": 197,
"h": "747ee5e3",
"en_raw": "are just your own answers in the end"
},
{
"n": 198,
"h": "e15b6fdc",
"en_raw": "In short, even if you reached"
},
{
"n": 199,
"h": "3997ddf6",
"en_raw": "the truth after your research"
},
{
"n": 200,
"h": "9e3434fb",
"en_raw": "to a pond frog, such truth"
},
{
"n": 201,
"h": "29b08560",
"en_raw": "is worse than horse dung"
},
{
"n": 202,
"h": "156522e7",
"en_raw": "Ha, so is Kurumi Shiina"
},
{
"n": 203,
"h": "976b1fdc",
"en_raw": "a frog?"
},
{
"n": 204,
"h": "626168e4",
"en_raw": "Yes, go ahead and take them"
},
{
"n": 205,
"h": "e0fa437e",
"en_raw": "Who knows"
},
{
"n": 206,
"h": "17fa0291",
"en_raw": "But that girl never"
},
{
"n": 207,
"h": "68a05191",
"en_raw": "wanted to agonize"
},
{
"n": 208,
"h": "19c66fa4",
"en_raw": "over human relations"
},
{
"n": 209,
